Server init.

>> x := Blob ùr: 65 seòrsa: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Prògram suidheachadh: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server ceangal: (
 Liosta ùr ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Liosta ùr ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x bho: 0 faid: 1), loidhne-ùr.
x saor.

